comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-11T11:10:40.136Z",codex-native-plugin-research,"Duplicate-check evidence 2026-07-11: pm context, list-open, list-in-progress, and all-status searches for native codex plugin, pm-codex Apps SDK, ChatGPT Codex plugin official docs, Codex plugin npx fallback cache, and native ChatGPT plugin found the closed shipped lineage pm-0c9q/pm-d97r plus Claude-only pm-l9wl/pm-dudr, but no item covering current OpenAI plugin and Apps SDK alignment. This feature extends rather than reopens the completed May implementation."
  "2026-09-23T05:26:46.285Z","harness:codex","Current official plugin packaging docs (checked 2026-09-23) prefer portable root plugin.json and mcp.json; the existing .codex-plugin/.mcp.json compatibility layout remains supported. This branch proves exact-version copied-cache MCP startup only. Portable layout, asset/skill validation, and any ChatGPT app or public submission remain under this existing feature, with no duplicate item created. Source: https://developers.openai.com/plugins/build/plugins"
  "2026-09-23T05:27:27.302Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: copied Codex plugin cache loaded @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.9.22 from a real packed local install and served MCP discovery/tools/context with npm unavailable at startup. This completes the version-coherent runtime slice; portable manifest/skill validation and separate ChatGPT app scope remain on this feature. Full gates remain in progress."
  "2026-09-23T18:06:02.060Z","harness:codex","Tranche evidence: Copied Codex plugin uses an exact @unbrained/pm-cli pin, private installed cache, native MCP launcher, and offline reuse; copied-cache acceptance and the full exact-coverage suite passed. The static PM_AUTHOR override was removed so runtime identity follows the host. Remaining official manifest/assets/skills and ChatGPT Apps SDK architecture and submission criteria remain open; this delivery does not claim a complete ChatGPT app."
  "2026-09-26T15:44:31.726Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-09-26: portable Agent Plugins 1.0.0 plugin.json and typed mcp.json now declare the pinned standalone Codex launcher; release version stamping and immutable manifest provenance share one inventory. The portable manifests validated against the official 1.0.0 schemas, Codex and packed offline cache smokes passed, and npm/npx plus Bun/bunx temporary installs passed. The separate ChatGPT Apps SDK lane and public submission remain open under the item approval boundary."
  "2026-09-26T16:13:03.694Z","harness:codex","PR #1317 hosted feedback revision: malformed portable MCP manifests now have transport, command, working-directory, argument-count, and launcher negative controls; the focused script covers 100% of its 44 statements, 26 branches, 1 function, and 43 lines. Packed Ubuntu first-run telemetry acceptance timed out at 30 seconds under hosted load; the bounded deadline is now 90 seconds, with the real collector and installed-package test passing locally. pnpm lint completed with repository assurance, CLI transport, graph-composition, record-integrity, and 323/330 killed-or-equivalent mutation evidence passing. Remaining ChatGPT Apps SDK and submission scope stays open."
